<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech March jobless rate 3.9 pct (4.1 pct in Feb).</title>
<headline>Czech March jobless rate 3.9 pct (4.1 pct in Feb).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic totalled 199,597, or 3.9 percent of the workforce, down from Febraury's rate of 4.1 percent, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
